  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/de0d85b17fe19a99067127b9dbc6f949e508d021.jpeg\" alt=\"幻想材質包頁頭\"></p>\n<h1>幻想材質包</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffantasy-texture-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"github-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"ghsponsors-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrandonitaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a></p>\n<p>讓你們自己穿越到一個騎士是英雄的年代。</p>\n<p>這個材質包為方塊、物品、實體和介面添加中世紀的幻想外觀。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/ffd23d5bcf27ef9393d150d2d041fb5cd842e6f7.jpeg\" alt=\"世界預覽\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/7063dbc217d3c1cb118b86341db61b74a75f4d8c.png\" alt=\"櫻桃林地\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/117e320bb53d29d2da5beb9a64ac4a2044ee966d.png\" alt=\"平原生物群的牛\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/e4896059092a26dab345650d6322f09cd7a779d9.png\" alt=\"毀壞的傳送門\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/cc0e3ad34bf5acf221a5dc9ef9a151248b5c9941.png alt=\"河流\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/902ab1b9c8312c02d541173ca54c9c34d4cd45f4.png alt=\"使用者介面\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此材質包將《Legacy Console Edition》的《Fantasy Texture Pack》移植，並從《Bedrock Edition》更新了原始紋理由 4J Studios 製作。</p>",
